# Branding defaults. These are committed on purpose — they hold no secrets, and
# they give the app a name when nothing overrides them.
#
# To rename the app for a deployment, set the same variables in that
# deployment's *build* environment instead of editing this file. See the
# "Renaming the app" section of README.md.
VITE_APP_NAME="Digital Flower Vase"
VITE_APP_DESCRIPTION="An interactive digital flower vase — customise the vase, arrange the flowers."
